{"articleNo":"97736","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=97736&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[생활관] 2014-1학기 가계곤란자 등 생활관 선발 결과 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.12.27","hit":"4723","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"view_content\" class=\"view_content\"><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2014학년도 1학기 가계곤란자 등 생활관 입사 신청자 중 합격자를 다음과 같이 발표하오니, 해당 학생들은 등록 기간 내에 등록하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span></span></span></span></span>&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><p><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><font size=\"2\">1. 2014학년도 1학기 가계곤라자 등 생활관 입사 신청 현황 및 합격 여부</font> </strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><strong><font size=\"2\">신청자</font> : 48명</strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><strong><font size=\"2\">합격자</font> : 46명</strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong></strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶&nbsp;</span></span></span></span><strong><font size=\"2\">불합격자</font> : 2명</strong> <font color=\"#0900ff\">(개별 통보)</font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 불합격자는&nbsp;공지사항 참고하여 2014. 1. 6(월)까지&nbsp;일반으로 생활관 입사 신청 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 합격자는 별도 통보 없습니다.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2.&nbsp;생활관비 등록</span></span></span></span></span></strong></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶</span></span></span></span>&nbsp;<strong>등록기간 :</strong> <strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\">2014. 1. 14(화) ~ 1. 17(금) 16:00까지</strong>(<font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" color=\"#0900ff\">개인별 가상계좌로 납부</font>)</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;</font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">3.&nbsp;생활관비 납부 및 확인 방법</span></strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">(</span><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\" color=\"#0900ff\">가상계좌로 납부</font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">※ 생활관비는 ‘납부고지서 출력 전’에 확정하여 납부서에 고지합니다</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 납부고지서 출력 : 원스톱서비스 - 생활관 - 생활관 신청결과/고지서출력</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 은행 직접 방문 납부 : 납부고지서 지참 (은행 영업시간 : 09:00~16:00)</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 인터넷뱅킹, 폰뱅킹, ATM기 이용 납부 : </span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-STYLE: italic; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">토, 일요일도 입금 가능</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&gt; </span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">받는사람 (학생본인) 이름 필히 확인</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;보내는 사람은 학생 이름이 아니라도 상관없음</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;가상계좌번호는 매학기 변경됨</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 생활관비 납부 확인 방법</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;은행 확인 : 실시간</span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&gt; </span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">학교 확인 : 납부 다음날 10:00 이후(원스톱서비스-생활관 신청결과/고지서출력)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">※ 납부기간 내 미등록자는 별도의 통보 없이 합격을 취소하고 차순위 자를 선발함</span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">4.&nbsp;기타 안내 </span></span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 입사일정 : </span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">2014.03.01(토) 14:00 ～ 03.02(일) 18:00</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 개사기간 : 2014.03.01(토) 14:00 ～ 06.24(수) 14:00</span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-INDENT: -13.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 13.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 입사 준비물 :</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 주민등록증 또는 운전면허증,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">세면도구, 개인 침구류</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶</span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> 입사 절차</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> </span></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"42\" valign=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"297\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Dotum,돋움\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">입사 등록 (푸름3동 현관, 오름관)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1